{"id":"n35087-1-3","stage":0,"title":"칠십 · 七十","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n35087-1-3-1","ko":"할머니, 연세가 어떻게 되세요?","zh":"奶奶，您多大年纪了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할머니,","meaning":"奶奶","explanation":"할머니：奶奶。","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"2","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}},{"text":"연세가","meaning":"年龄（敬语）","explanation":"연세：年龄的尊敬说法；-가 标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연세","audio":"/audio/fc2837075a9efa4e8f57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14018","senseId":"1","lemma":"연세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연세가","audio":"/audio/2ffe8e2c201e645f9e1e.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"多大","explanation":"어떻게：怎样；与 연세가 되세요 连用，礼貌询问年龄，相当于“多大年纪”。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"되세요?","meaning":"是、多大（敬语）","explanation":"되다：达到某个年龄；-세요 是尊敬而礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되세요","audio":"/audio/d607485c0b9928bd7ea1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"(亲近)用于指称或称呼年老的女性。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"fc2837075a9efa4e","term":"연세","zh":"年龄（敬语）","audio":"/audio/fc2837075a9efa4e8f57.mp3","entryId":"14018","definition":"对长辈或年长者的年龄的尊敬说法。","pronunciation":["연세"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎样、如何","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"询问方式或状态；这里的 어떻게 用于询问年龄。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id